    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Manta is an elegantly designed three-bedroom end-of-terrace home, offering bright and spacious contemporary living, stylish finishes and excellent energy efficiency, with the added appeal of an end position.\r\n\r\nThe rushed mornings. The coffee on the way to work. Boots left at the door after training. Friends around the kitchen table. Quiet Sundays. Busy Mondays. The everyday things that eventually become the things you remember.\r\n\r\nThat thinking sits at the heart of Hawks Bay...\r\n\r\nBuilt by Durkan and brought to the market by Forkin Earls Property, Hawks Bay is a new collection of energy-efficient two, three and four-bedroom homes created for the way people actually live. Generous spaces, considered layouts, a high-quality specification and energy-efficient design come together to create homes that feel good to live in, not just good to look at.\r\n\r\nAnd life beyond the front door matters just as much.\r\n\r\nSchools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and everyday essentials are all within easy reach, while a thriving sporting community means there is no shortage of ways to get involved. GAA, soccer, rugby, golf, tennis and water sports are all part of life locally, whether you’re taking part yourself or spending your Saturday morning cheering from the sideline.\r\n\r\nWhen work or life takes you further afield, Hawks Bay is well connected. The M11 provides straightforward access towards Dublin and the M50, Wicklow Train Station offers services to Pearse and Connolly Stations, and bus connections provide another option for travel to Dublin and surrounding areas. \r\n\r\nHawks Bay isn’t about creating rows of new houses. It’s about creating a place people will make their own, first homes, family homes, next homes and, for some, forever homes.\r\n\r\nHomes for the life that happens inside them.\r\n\r\nCall the Forkin Earls Property New Homes Team on 0404 61933 to register your interest.\r\n\r\n*Plans and dimensions are indicative only and are subject to change.*"
      },
      {
